    "sections": {
        "description": "X Blog Lite – is a free, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress blog theme with full RTL (Right-to-Left) language support. This is the child theme of X Blog theme. X Blog Lite features a clean, minimal design with modern color accents, perfect for personal blogs, lifestyle sites, and content-focused websites. X Blog Lite is highly customizable with flexible layout options and Gutenberg block editor compatibility. The theme has professional, SEO-optimized layouts with clean HTML5 and CSS3 code for fast loading speed and better search engine rankings. X Blog Lite is ideal for bloggers, writers, and creatives who want a beautiful, mobile-friendly website."
    },
